  "description": "C# library to extract text from PDF, DOCX, PPTX, RTF, and TXT. Convert to a string, a TXT file, or Markdown. PDF tables keep multi-word cells. IncludeCoordinates prints PDF boxes. Reads filled PDF forms and password-protected PDFs.",
